{"id":"n62741-1-10","stage":1,"title":"달다 · 甜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62741-1-10-1","ko":"주스에 설탕을 좀 더 넣어야 할 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得果汁里可能需要再加点糖。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주스에","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설탕을","meaning":"糖，砂糖","explanation":"설탕：糖，砂糖；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설탕","audio":"/audio/7921a3bb40fa91bb6caf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62507","senseId":"1","lemma":"설탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣어야","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7921a3bb40fa91bb","term":"설탕","zh":"糖，砂糖","audio":"/audio/7921a3bb40fa91bb6caf.mp3","entryId":"62507","definition":"一种易溶于水的白色粉末，用于增加食物的甜味。","pronunciation":["설탕"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/17dc3a5eca707b407fca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62741-1-10-2","ko":"음식을 너무 달게 먹는 건 안 좋아.","zh":"食物吃得太甜可不好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meani